!src-tauri/gen/android/
# (Build outputs, machine-local files, and Tauri-regenerated files under
# gen/android are excluded by the project's own nested .gitignore files.
# These two are not, so they are excluded here:)
# - assets/bin: stale desktop sidecar once copied by bundle.resources
#   (mobile now overrides resources to []); never commit binaries.
# - .kotlin/sessions: IDE daemon state.
src-tauri/gen/android/app/src/main/assets/bin/
src-tauri/gen/android/.kotlin/
# local bytecode from syntax checks; device gets fresh .pyc from Chaquopy
src-tauri/gen/android/app/src/main/python/__pycache__/
